  "title": "Shop Stock",
  "summary": "Count stock by scanning barcodes, see what to reorder, export to CSV.",
  "description": "Keep track of what is on the shelves of a small shop, workshop or storeroom. Scan a barcode to find an item or add a new one, then record what comes in and goes out. Items at or below their reorder level are flagged, and you get a notification when one runs low.\n\n- **Scan to count:** find an item by its barcode in a second.\n- **Stock value** per item and in total.\n- **Export** the stock list as a CSV file.\n\n**What it never does:** no ads, no tracking and no account. Your stock list stays on this phone until you export it.",
